# Binary files -- never apply line-ending normalization, text diffing,
# or merging to these. Missing this file is why aspirin_conformal_indist.pt
# and aspirin_mc_dropout_indist.pt showed as "modified" with no one having
# touched them since June 9 -- git was silently treating them as text and
# renormalizing line endings on every checkout/diff.

*.pt binary
*.pth binary
*.npz binary
*.npy binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.pdf binary
*.pkl binary
*.pickle binary
*.exe binary
*.ckpt binary
